## RPC

Standard Solana JSON-RPC. Any Solana SDK works: `@solana/web3.js`, `solana-py`, `solana` Rust crate.

**Endpoint:**

```
https://rpc.carbium.io/?apiKey=YOUR_RPC_KEY
```

### TypeScript

```typescript
